remarks.para:
Nothing here can fail in a way that matters. A missing, short, corrupt or foreign file is a miss;
an unwritable directory is a cache that never persists; and either way the backend builds its
pipelines exactly as it did before this existed.

member.param:
Where NVIDIA's Streamline runtime is, or  to run without it. When it starts,
the instance and device are created through it and  is set;
when it does not, the device is exactly what it would have been and the log says why.
